{
  "id": "ACT.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Ebikorwa 13",
  "verseCount": 51,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu nteko ya Antiokia hakaba halimu abarangi n'abegesa: abalimu Barinaba, Simeoni owo bayetaaga Nigeri, Lukio owa Kirene, Manaeni ayabaire akuzire hamoi na Herode omugavana, na Sauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kababaire nibashoma enshara aha Mukama nibasiba, Mwoyo Mutakatifu abagambira ati, “Munyahulire Barinaba na Sauli bakore omulimo ogwo mbeteire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabamazire kusiiba n'okushoma enshara, babataho emikono babatuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo batumirwe Mwoyo Mutakatifu Barinaba na Sauli bagya Selusia; bemayo basabara bagya Sipuro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaagobaire Salami, baranga ekigambo kya Ruhanga omu sinagogi z'Abayahudi. Yohana akaba nabahwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo barabire omu kizinga kyona bakagoba Pafosi, bagwamu omukonikoni omoi omurangi w'ebishuba Omuyahudi eibaralye Bariyesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba naikara n'omuragirwa Serigio Paulo, omuntu omugezi. Serigio Paulo ayeta Barinaba na Sauli agondize kuhulira ekigambo kya Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Elimasi omukonikoni (kuba egyo niyo nshonga y'eibaralye) abahakanisa, agondize kutanga omuragirwa kwikiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Sauli, alikwetwa Paulo, aijwirwe Mwoyo Mutakatifu amukomeeka eliisho ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amugambira ati, “Iwe mwana wa Sitani iwe, iwe mubisha wa buli karungi, oijwire obugobya n'orwango, olekere kuhindura amazima g'Omukama kabiba bishuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu obone, Omukama yakuha ekibonabonyio: Orahuma, omare ebiro otalikubona mushana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho omuragirwa kayaboine okwo byaba bityo aikiliza, kuba ebyo bamwegesize aha Mukama bikamushobeza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma Paulo na batahibe baruga Pafosi basabara bagoba Periga omuli Pamfilia. Yohana yabasigayo yagaruka Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonene baruga Periga bagya Antiokia eya Pisidia. Aha kiro kya Sabato bataha omu sinagogi bashuntama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabamazire kushoma omu Mateka n'omu Barangi, abatwazi b'esinagogi babatumaho bati, “Barumuna, kamuraba mwina ekigambo kyona kyona eky'okuchumbiza abantu, mukigambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Paulo kwemelera, aimukya omukono agamba ati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inywe Baisiraeli abatina Ruhanga muhulire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga w'eihanga eli lya Isiraeli akaronda batat'enkurw'ichwe, yamara yabahindura ihanga lihango orwo baturaga Misiri, yashuba yabaihisamu obushobora bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyaka 40 yabegumisiliza omw'irungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayabaire yasilikize amahanga mushanju omuli Kanaani, ensi egyo yagibaha obusika bagilya emyaka nka 450. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma yabaha abaramuzi kugoba ahali Samweli omurangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bamushaba omukama, yabateraho Sauli eya Kishi ow'oruganda rwa Benjamini yabatwara emyaka 40. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayabaire yamwihireho, omukama wabo yabateraho Daudi owo yayebugire ati, ‘Mboine Daudi mutabani wa Yese omuntu owo ngonza, n'iwe alikora byona ebyo ndikwenda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli baijukuru ba Daudi nimwo Ruhanga aihire Isiraeli omurokozi, Yesu, nk'okwo yaragaine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwo kayabaire atakaizire Yohana yarangiraga Abaisiraeli bona okwechuza entambara bakabatizibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana ogwo kayabaire yaija kumara eikoralye abaza ati, ‘Nimulenga muti ndi ohai? Tindiwe. Chei, haliyo alikunduga enyuma, owo ntasaine kujura biratwa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Barumuna bange, baijukuru ba Aburahamu n'Abanyamahanga abali aha abalikutina Ruhanga, ekigambo eki ky'okuturokora Omukama akitwekeire ichwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Yerusalemu n'abatwazi babo, aha rw'okutamumanya anga kushobokerwa ebyabagambirwe abarangi ebishomwa buli Sabato, ebyo bakabigobesheleza orwo bamuramwire kufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'orwo babuzirwe omushango gw'okumutaho kumwisa, bakagambira Pilato kumuramura kufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kababaire bagobaesheleize byona ebyabaire bimuhandikirweho, bamuhanantura aha muti, bamuziika omu nyanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Ruhanga akamuhimbura omu bafu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yamara ebiro bingi nahabukira abo yarugire nabo Galilaya kwija Yerusalemu, mbwenu nibo bajulizi omu bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu tubaleteire amakuru garungi okwo ekyo Ruhanga yashuubiize batat'enkurw'ichwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akigobesheleize ahali ichwe baijukuru babo orwo yahimbwire Yesu. Nk'okwo kyakahandikirwe omu Zaburi ya kabili kiti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha rw'okuba Daudi kayamazire kugobesheleza ebyo Ruhanga yamuragiire omu burorabwe, yafa, bamuziika omu nziiko za baishenkuru mara yajunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai owo Ruhanga yahimbwire tiyajunzire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo barumuna mumanye okwo omugaruliro gw'amafu ogwo tulikubagambira niguletwa aha muntu ogu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara n'iwe achungura buli muntu amwesiga, akamuchungura omuli buli kantu ako Amateka ga Musa gatakubachungwiremu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo mulimanya mutaligwerwa ekyo abarangi bagambire bati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Leba inywe abaruulira banu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo abantu barugire omu sinagogi bakataha, Abayahudi bangi n'Abanyamahanga ababaire baina ekihika omu dini y'Abayahudi bahondera Paulo na Barinaba, aba babafumolera mara babachumbiza kuguma aha mugisha gwa Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sabato eyahondeireho, nk'ekigo kyona kihurura kuhulira ekigambo kya Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Abayahudi kababoine okwo abantu baba embaga bakwatwa eihagiko, bahakanisa ebyo Paulo yagambire mara bamuleerura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo na Barinaba bagambira kimoi n'obumanzi bati, “Kibaire nikyetagwa ekigambo kya Ruhanga kubanza kukigambira inywe. Mbwenu orwo mwakyanga, mukagamba okwo oburora obutalihwaho mutabusaine, leba twagya omu Banyamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enshonga Omukama n'iwe atuhangiire ati, ‘Nkutaireho k'oba mushana gw'Abanyamahanga, oshobore otyo kurokora ensi zona.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamahanga kabahuliire batyo bashemelerwa, basingiza n'ekigambo kya Ruhanga; n'ababaire baronkeirwe oburora obutalihwaho baikiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo ky'Omukama kigoba omu mukoa ogwo gwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Abayahudi bohya abakazi n'abashaija abalikumanyika mara abashongore ab'amani omu kigo, babachokeza Paulo na Barinaba babagingiza, bababinga omu wilaya yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonene aba basiga babakunkumulira echuuchu aha maguru nibabakeena, bakwata omuhanda bagya Ikonio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai abegesibwa baijurwa ebyera, na Mwoyo Mutakatifu abasingiramu wena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
